      "text": "Lehi1 and others prophesy in first year of Zedekiah’s reign, 1 Ne. 1:4. brass plates contain record of Jews to beginning of Zedekiah’s reign, 1 Ne. 5:10–13. people of Zarahemla came from Jerusalem at time Zedekiah was taken captive to Babylon, Omni 1:15. Mulek was son of Zedekiah, Hel. 6:10. all Zedekiah’s sons slain except Mulek, Hel. 8:21.",
